        "thought_text": "Revised Thought-2: Ensure that the calculated takeoff_time is checked against the safety gap requirements before breaking out of the loop. If the gap is insufficient, continue iterating until a valid slot is found or the end of the list is reached. Additionally, handle the edge case where the takeoff can be inserted immediately after the last landing.",
