        "thought_text": "Consider adjusting the calculation of the takeoff time after the last landing. Instead of calculating the takeoff time as `landings[-1][0] + (landings[-1][1] + s + 1) // 60` and `landings[-1][1] + s + 1 % 60`, directly compute the time just after the last landing plus the required safety margin. This ensures the takeoff time is calculated correctly without errors.",
